# M17 forged weapons (docs/CLIENT_RENDERING.md §18), flow "m17_weapons" side Kargan: every new weapon model in the hands
# (cosmetic `scene wieldmodel`, placed with the grip rows of gamedata/attachments.toml) over a Sağlam leather set (contrast with the steel), front and
# side. Screenshots: docs/screenshots/m17_art/weapons_kargan_*.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m17_weap_k
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Silahbey
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded 1800
waitfor world+nobanner 400
scene wear 0 91 92 93 94
scene focusdrop 0.5
scene wieldmodel sword_ridge sword shield_tower shield
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 2
scene camera front@30 8 2.4
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_sword_ridge_tower_left.png
scene camera front@-45 8 2.4
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_sword_ridge_tower_right.png
scene wieldmodel sword_curved sword shield_buckler shield
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 2
scene camera front@30 8 2.4
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_sword_curved_buckler_left.png
scene camera front@-45 8 2.4
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_sword_curved_buckler_right.png
scene wieldmodel dagger_fang dagger dagger_twin dagger
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 2
scene camera front@30 8 2.4
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_daggers_left.png
scene camera front@-45 8 2.4
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_daggers_right.png
scene wieldmodel mace_flanged mace
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 1
scene camera front@-45 8 2.4
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_mace_flanged.png
scene wieldmodel mace_spiked mace
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 1
scene camera front@-45 8 2.4
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_mace_spiked.png
scene wieldmodel sword_broad axe2h
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 1
scene camera front@30 8 2.9
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_sword_broad_left.png
scene camera front@-45 8 2.9
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_sword_broad_right.png
scene wieldmodel hammer_war axe2h
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 1
scene camera front@-45 8 2.9
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_hammer_war.png
scene wieldmodel axe_bearded axe2h
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 1
scene camera front@-45 8 2.9
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_axe_bearded.png
scene wieldmodel halberd axe2h
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 1
scene camera front@30 8 3.3
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_halberd_left.png
scene camera front@-45 8 3.3
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_halberd_right.png
scene wieldmodel staff_ritual staff
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 1
scene camera front@-45 8 2.9
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_staff_ritual.png
scene wieldmodel staff_crystal staff
wait 45
scene expectlocalweapons 1
scene camera front@-45 8 2.9
wait 15
screenshot weapons_kargan_staff_crystal.png
quit
